<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET - SRI LANKA VS NZ SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET - SRI LANKA VS NZ SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard</p>
<p>from the second and final one-day match between New Zealand and</p>
<p>Sri Lanka on Thursday.</p>
<p>New Zealand</p>
<p> B.Young lbw b Vaas				    2</p>
<p> N.Astle c Muralitharan b Zoysa		   12</p>
<p> M.Horne c Kaluwitharana b Muralitharan	 14</p>
<p> S.Fleming c Tillekaratne b Zoysa		  9</p>
<p> C.Cairns b Vaas					56</p>
<p> C.Harris b Muralitharan			     5</p>
<p> A.Parore run out				     39</p>
<p> G.Larsen run out				     26</p>
<p> S.Doull c Chandana b Vaas			  18</p>
<p> A.Penn c de Silva b Vaas			    1</p>
<p> H.Davis not out					 1</p>
<p>   Extras (lb-8, w-8, nb-2)			 18</p>
<p>    Total (after 49.2 overs)		     201</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-17, 2-17, 3-28, 4-71, 5-91, 6-125, 7-156,</p>
<p>8-199, 9-199, 10-201.</p>
<p>Bowling: C.Vaas 9.2-1-26-4, N.Zoysa 10-1-47-2 (w-4, nb-1),</p>
<p>K.Dharmasena 10-0-41-0 (w-2), M.Muralitharan 10-1-32-2 (w-1,</p>
<p>nb-1), S.Jayasuriya 5-0-30-0 (w-1), A.Ranatunga 5-0-17-0.</p>
<p>Sri Lanka</p>
<p> S.Jayasuriya b Davis			     0 </p>
<p> R.Kaluwitharana lbw b Davis		   23 </p>
<p> R.Mahanama c Young b Doull		    10</p>
<p> A. de Silva c Fleming b Davis		 36</p>
<p> A.Ranatunga b Harris			    16</p>
<p> H.Tillekaratne b Astle			   8</p>
<p> K.Dharmasena st Parore b Harris		2</p>
<p> U.Chandana lbw b Astle			   3</p>
<p> C.Vaas c Doull b Astle			   0</p>
<p> N.Zoysa not out				    3 </p>
<p> M.Muralitharan b Davis			   2 </p>
<p>  Extras (lb-13, w-16)			   29</p>
<p>    Total (37.2 overs)			  132</p>
