<p>7-121, 8-125, 9-126, 10-132.</p>
<p>Bowling: A.Penn 2-0-14-0 (w-5), H.Davis 8.2-0-35-4 (w-5),</p>
<p>S.Doull 4-0-21-1 (w-2), G.Larsen 7-5-9-0 (w-2), C.Harris</p>
<p>10-2-31-2 (w-1), N Astle 6-1-9-3 (w-1).</p>
<p>Result: New Zealand win by 69 runs. Three-match series</p>
<p>squared 1-all. The first match in Auckland last weekend was</p>
<p>abandoned because of rain.</p>
<p>Man of the match: C. Cairns.</p>
